00:11:24.450 --> 00:11:26.819
That can't be right, I...

00:11:26.819 --> 00:11:28.446
I...

00:11:29.855 --> 00:11:31.550
stand out?!

00:11:48.307 --> 00:11:50.104
I said, this bitch is frickin' weird!

00:11:50.643 --> 00:11:52.044
And I said, shut up!

00:11:52.044 --> 00:11:53.136
But!

00:11:55.614 --> 00:11:57.605
Ganging up on a girl?

00:11:57.683 --> 00:11:59.852
Kyo.. Kyohei!

00:11:59.852 --> 00:12:02.252
We... we were just...

00:12:03.322 --> 00:12:04.414
What the?!

00:12:05.658 --> 00:12:09.219
You need to stop this bullshit!

00:12:09.428 --> 00:12:10.429
Kyohei is...

00:12:10.429 --> 00:12:12.498
Holding the ugly girl!

00:12:12.498 --> 00:12:13.265
I... I'm gonna melt.
Holding the ugly girl!

00:12:13.265 --> 00:12:14.129
I... I'm gonna melt.

00:12:14.200 --> 00:12:17.499
Throb

00:12:21.607 --> 00:12:23.302
Hey, are you all right?

00:12:25.511 --> 00:12:29.181
W.. Well... sc.. scissors?!

00:12:29.181 --> 00:12:31.149
It's nothing! It's nothing!

00:12:33.686 --> 00:12:36.849
See? The scissors are gone!
Come on, Kyohei, give me a break!

00:12:42.895 --> 00:12:45.159
What have you done?!

00:12:45.865 --> 00:12:47.662
Don't worry, it's nothing.

00:13:03.415 --> 00:13:04.541
A...

00:13:04.850 --> 00:13:06.147
A...

00:13:06.552 --> 00:13:07.917
Amazing!

00:13:10.322 --> 00:13:11.957
Sunako! Kyohei!

00:13:11.957 --> 00:13:13.584
What the? Are you guys...

00:13:16.395 --> 00:13:17.862
What is this?

00:13:25.871 --> 00:13:27.168
SNIP

00:13:29.675 --> 00:13:32.143
How do you like me now?
Now I won't stand out anymore!

00:13:33.813 --> 00:13:36.441
How dare you pull out these things?

00:13:36.816 --> 00:13:39.251
Apologize to this Creature of the Light!

00:13:39.251 --> 00:13:40.586
Creature of the Light?!

00:13:40.586 --> 00:13:43.077
Look how commanding Sunako is.

00:13:43.622 --> 00:13:44.990
She's so cool!

00:13:44.990 --> 00:13:47.686
Oh my god...

00:13:50.296 --> 00:13:51.991
Kyohei, are you okay?

00:13:52.731 --> 00:13:55.100
Your face is really red.

00:13:55.100 --> 00:13:56.936
Maybe you have a fever.

00:13:56.936 --> 00:13:58.671
Hurry up and put your jacket on.

00:13:58.671 --> 00:14:02.072
Sunako, I'm sorry to ask you this,
but will you go home early with him?

00:14:03.075 --> 00:14:05.873
Since you're partially responsible for this.

00:14:06.679 --> 00:14:07.646
Here!

00:14:08.447 --> 00:14:10.749
H.. He's heavy.

00:14:10.749 --> 00:14:12.546
But before that I might melt!

00:14:12.985 --> 00:14:17.479
W.. Wait... Why is Sunako Nakahara
taking Kyohei home?

00:14:17.756 --> 00:14:20.452
'Cuz we all live together.

00:14:23.062 --> 00:14:24.430
This is a nightmare.

00:14:24.430 --> 00:14:27.160
Being all alone with a
Creature of the Light like him...

00:14:32.605 --> 00:14:35.040
W.. Would you like something to eat?!

00:14:35.040 --> 00:14:37.167
St.. Strawberries...

00:14:37.409 --> 00:14:39.578
Oh my god, he's even more radiant!

00:14:39.578 --> 00:14:41.313
Certainly!

00:14:41.313 --> 00:14:43.082
Make it happen within thrity seconds!

00:14:43.082 --> 00:14:46.585
But it takes me more than thirty seconds
to get to the refrigerator!

00:14:46.585 --> 00:14:47.711
Hurry up!

00:14:48.654 --> 00:14:50.990
Here's your strawberries!

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:53.092
I wanna an energy drink instead.

00:14:53.092 --> 00:14:55.287
Here's your energy drink!

00:14:55.794 --> 00:14:58.422
I want some ice cream instead,
strawberry flavored.

00:14:59.331 --> 00:15:02.034
Here's your ice cream. It's Yukinojo brand.

00:15:02.034 --> 00:15:04.559
I want some yogurt instead,
strawberry flavored.

00:15:05.938 --> 00:15:08.340
Here's your yogurt! It's Takenaga brand!

00:15:08.340 --> 00:15:11.176
I want some jelly instead...
No, cancel that.

00:15:11.176 --> 00:15:12.973
Clean up the room. It's messy.

00:15:14.013 --> 00:15:15.173
Okay...

00:15:15.247 --> 00:15:16.582
Don't go touching everything, all right?

00:15:16.582 --> 00:15:18.183
What, do you expect me to use
psychic powers or something?

00:15:18.183 --> 00:15:18.751
Give me my pajamas.

00:15:18.751 --> 00:15:19.518
Yes!
Give me my pajamas.

00:15:19.518 --> 00:15:20.686
The clothes over there need to be washed.

00:15:20.686 --> 00:15:21.520
Yes!
The clothes over there need to be washed.

00:15:21.520 --> 00:15:22.254
Now I want some strawberries.

00:15:22.254 --> 00:15:23.152
Yes! Yes!
Now I want some strawberries.

00:15:23.589 --> 00:15:25.791
It must be the work of evil!

00:15:25.791 --> 00:15:27.349
It must be the great radiant demon!

00:15:27.826 --> 00:15:31.023
Here you go. I've got strawberries,
an energy drink, ice cream and yogurt jelly!

00:15:31.330 --> 00:15:33.195
Can you make some porridge instead?

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:38.003
Murderous Intent!
Should I just go ahead and
choke him to death?!

00:15:38.003 --> 00:15:38.704
Should I just go ahead and
choke him to death?!

00:15:38.704 --> 00:15:39.939
Sorry...

00:15:39.939 --> 00:15:40.906
Huh?

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:43.509
I said, I'm sorry.

00:15:43.509 --> 00:15:45.010
About last night.

00:15:45.010 --> 00:15:47.979
I didn't see anything because it was
too foggy, so don't worry about it.

00:15:53.953 --> 00:15:55.181
Po.. Porridge...

00:15:59.158 --> 00:16:01.217
Howdy, Sunako!

00:16:01.560 --> 00:16:04.730
Takenaga sent me here with
some get-well gifts!

00:16:04.730 --> 00:16:06.960
It's Kyohei's favorite: strawberries!

00:16:08.133 --> 00:16:12.338
Excuse me, lady named Noi, please switch with
me and take care of him instead of me!

00:16:12.338 --> 00:16:13.396
No way.

00:16:14.173 --> 00:16:17.142
But since I have some time, I wouldn't
mind chit-chatting with you though!

00:16:17.276 --> 00:16:18.777
Huh?

00:16:18.777 --> 00:16:20.779
You're dizzy, can't stop bleeding
from the nose,

00:16:20.779 --> 00:16:24.579
are going to melt and die soon because
Kyohei is too radiant?

00:16:25.718 --> 00:16:28.620
Putting that aside, why are all the flowers
dead only in that section?

00:16:28.620 --> 00:16:30.588
It has nothing to do with what
we're talking about.

00:16:30.923 --> 00:16:35.394
I just can't do this anymore. I can't be
near him! I don't wanna go near him!

00:16:35.394 --> 00:16:38.557
I see! So, you like Kyohei, huh?

00:16:38.664 --> 00:16:40.165
Bluntly
Oh, that's not it at all.

00:16:40.165 --> 00:16:42.531
Bluntly
Bummer! That's no fun!

00:16:42.735 --> 00:16:45.829
That's right, it's all that Creature's fault!

00:16:46.138 --> 00:16:49.938
It's all because Creatures of the
Light exist in this world!

00:16:50.776 --> 00:16:54.246
You're pretty interesting!
I don't understand your thinking process!

00:16:54.246 --> 00:16:58.283
Stupid Adam! Stupid Eve! Stupid DNA!
Stupid Pithecanthropus!

00:16:58.283 --> 00:17:03.989
I don't really know what's going on, but why
don't you be radiant just like them?

00:17:03.989 --> 00:17:06.514
You should stop being so gloomy
and be more lively instead!

00:17:10.529 --> 00:17:13.987
It's easy for you to say that because you're
one of the Creatures of the Light.

00:17:14.266 --> 00:17:16.564
I'm one of them too? How lucky!

00:17:17.136 --> 00:17:21.540
Please don't put us both in the
same creature category.

00:17:21.540 --> 00:17:24.941
Because from an opposite standpoint,
you sound like you don't know your place.

00:17:25.711 --> 00:17:28.942
That's the last thing I want to hear from someone
who makes no effort whatsoever!

00:17:30.682 --> 00:17:37.122
I've been working so much harder than others
just to make Takenaga think I'm cute!

00:17:37.122 --> 00:17:37.918
Working?

00:17:41.727 --> 00:17:42.494
The Road to Womanhood!

00:17:42.494 --> 00:17:44.621
The Road to Womanhood!
The Road to Womanhood!

00:17:45.831 --> 00:17:48.200
When you want to be a lady
with a beautiful smile...

00:17:48.200 --> 00:17:50.869
Pout your lips like an octopus and say " Ooh!"

00:17:50.869 --> 00:17:53.372
After that open your mouth sideways...

00:17:53.372 --> 00:17:54.840
and say " ei" !

00:17:54.840 --> 00:17:56.508
Ooeiooeiooeiooei!

00:17:56.508 --> 00:17:57.532
WRONG!

00:17:58.210 --> 00:18:01.013
It's pointless unless you do it
slowly and properly!

00:18:01.013 --> 00:18:02.815
Take a break if it becomes painful!

00:18:02.815 --> 00:18:05.579
Hey, Takenaga, what do you
think about my smile?

00:18:06.618 --> 00:18:07.853
I can't take this anymore.

00:18:07.853 --> 00:18:09.047
Ooei!

00:18:10.489 --> 00:18:13.458
The Road to Womanhood!
To Be Continued

00:18:14.660 --> 00:18:16.795
I envy you, Sunako.

00:18:16.795 --> 00:18:20.595
Because you get to see Takenaga's
face every single day!

00:18:20.933 --> 00:18:26.394
He seems cool and serious at school,
but what is he like at home usually?

00:18:26.638 --> 00:18:29.741
I don't know, because he's too radiant to see.

00:18:29.741 --> 00:18:30.742
Oh, I see...

00:18:30.742 --> 00:18:31.410
You must like Takenaga, Noi.
Oh, I see...

00:18:31.410 --> 00:18:33.640
You must like Takenaga, Noi.

00:18:33.812 --> 00:18:35.609
Yup! I love him so much!

00:18:37.116 --> 00:18:42.611
Sunako, you know your appearance can be
easily altered as long as you make an effort.

00:18:42.988 --> 00:18:46.856
So, stop living in the Darkness. Good luck!

00:18:47.025 --> 00:18:48.427
That's just what a person who
