00:18:58.837 --> 00:19:00.506
Or is it those Creatures of the Light's fault?

00:19:00.506 --> 00:19:02.341
No, the person who's most responsible
for this is God!

00:19:02.341 --> 00:19:05.344
Oh, by the way, Sunako,
did Noi come by here?

00:19:05.344 --> 00:19:08.108
Sure she did, thanks to her I have
attained enlightenment.

00:19:08.413 --> 00:19:09.982
Noi's pretty amazing.

00:19:09.982 --> 00:19:11.550
Look what she's done by simply
delivering strawberries.

00:19:11.550 --> 00:19:13.051
